{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734408",
      "title": "Adding Lazy Loading",
      "sourceHash": "5cc436c15aeab33a8f718c1652456f22553e3871a882dbd8bd757a0ff68b089d",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.807,
          "end": 4.98,
          "en": "(Teacher) So, how do we now add lazy loading?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.98,
          "end": 8.16,
          "en": "Well, let's say we wanna load that blog page lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.16,
          "end": 9.54,
          "en": "So, only when we need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.54,
          "end": 11.876,
          "en": "The code for the blog page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.876,
          "end": 14.25,
          "en": "and all the code referenced by that blog page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.25,
          "end": 15.083,
          "en": "so for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.083,
          "end": 16.89,
          "en": "the code for the post list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.89,
          "end": 18.933,
          "en": "should only be loaded when we need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.77,
          "end": 22.14,
          "en": "So for example, when we visit this website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.14,
          "end": 23.71,
          "en": "and we land on the homepage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.775,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "we don't need the blog page code yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 29.52,
          "en": "We will only need it later once we navigate there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.52,
          "end": 32.37,
          "en": "And at that point of time, once we navigate there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.37,
          "end": 33.723,
          "en": "it should be downloaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.803,
          "end": 37.103,
          "en": "And that's exactly what lazy loading will do for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.068,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "So, in order to load this blog page lazily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "we first of all have to remove this import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "Otherwise, it's always loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.17,
          "en": "It's loaded eagerly, as it's called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 48.06,
          "en": "So, we must get rid of that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.06,
          "end": 50.79,
          "en": "Then, as a next step we have to re-add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 50.79,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "but in a way that it's only loaded when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "Now, it's actually worth noting that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 57.12,
          "en": "with this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 57.12,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "we're not just importing the blog page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 61.023,
          "en": "but also the loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 61.023,
          "end": 62.52,
          "en": "So we're actually importing two things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 62.52,
          "end": 64.59,
          "en": "which we should now load lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 64.59,
          "end": 67.68,
          "en": "And it actually will start with the loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 67.68,
          "end": 70.09,
          "en": "So, the loader is being used down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 71.43299999999999,
          "end": 73.18,
          "en": "and here to load it lazily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 73.18,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "we can pass a function to the loader here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "So replace the loader from before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 79.62,
          "en": "with a different loader function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 79.62,
          "end": 81.63,
          "en": "and that should be a function where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 81.63,
          "end": 85.05,
          "en": "in the end call at import function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 85.05,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "Now this import keyword,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 87.78,
          "en": "is a keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 87.78,
          "end": 90.12,
          "en": "we of course saw plenty of times already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 90.12,
          "end": 92.61,
          "en": "We use it to import files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "but it turns out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 96.53999999999999,
          "en": "that you can actually also call import as a function and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "in that case it will import something dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 101.10300000000001,
          "en": "only when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 104.43,
          "en": "Now, to import you pass a path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 104.43,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "In my case here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 108.093,
          "en": "the path to pages blog.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 109.19,
          "end": 110.82,
          "en": "And then import gives you a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 113.931,
          "en": "Because this is an asynchronous process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 113.931,
          "end": 115.39,
          "en": "which can take a bit longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 115.39,
          "end": 117.06,
          "en": "because it must download the code after all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 117.06,
          "end": 120.21,
          "en": "And, downloading that code can take a short while.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 120.21,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "So import gives you a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 124.47,
          "en": "and we can change the then keyword here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 124.47,
          "end": 126.82,
          "en": "Alternatively, we could have used asynch weight",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 127.669,
          "end": 128.933,
          "en": "but here I'll use the then keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 129.812,
          "end": 132.542,
          "en": "And then what we get here is the loaded module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 132.542,
          "end": 133.74,
          "en": "so the loaded file in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 134.859,
          "end": 135.692,
          "en": "And on that module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 135.692,
          "end": 138.36,
          "en": "I now wanna return the loader function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 138.36,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "And of course that loader function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 141.48,
          "en": "should be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 141.48,
          "end": 142.77,
          "en": "That loader function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 142.77,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "as we know then returns a promise, which yields a response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 147.87,
          "en": "and therefore, now with that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 147.87,
          "end": 151.71,
          "en": "our loader here will in the end yield that promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 151.71,
          "end": 154.2,
          "en": "which is yielded by that loader function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 154.2,
          "end": 158.1,
          "en": "But, all of that will be done by loading this lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 158.1,
          "end": 159.99,
          "en": "So now this import function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 159.99,
          "end": 161.4,
          "en": "will only be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 161.4,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "once the loader here, for the blog page is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 167.73,
          "en": "So only once we try to visit the blog page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 167.73,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "Only then the blog file will be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "and this loader function from that file will be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 175.74,
          "en": "That's what's happening here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 175.74,
          "end": 178.98,
          "en": "With that, we're loading that loader function lazily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 178.98,
          "end": 180.28,
          "en": "and that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 182.31,
          "en": "The next step is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 182.31,
          "end": 185.88,
          "en": "to also load the blog page component lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 185.88,
          "end": 188.013,
          "en": "Now, here we could use a similar approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 189.161,
          "end": 191.298,
          "en": "We could set this equal to a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 191.298,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "so to a component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 194.88,
          "en": "which in the end returns the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 194.88,
          "end": 198.42000000000002,
          "en": "dynamically imported blog page component file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 198.42000000000002,
          "end": 201.32999999999998,
          "en": "So, we again, reach out to pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 201.32999999999998,
          "end": 202.71,
          "en": "blog",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 202.71,
          "end": 203.88,
          "en": "and we know that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 203.88,
          "end": 207.843,
          "en": "in there our default export is that blog page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 208.74,
          "end": 210.69,
          "en": "However, this alone won't do the trick",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 210.69,
          "end": 215.67000000000002,
          "en": "because this here is not a valid functional component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 215.67000000000002,
          "end": 218.97,
          "en": "Because, whilst you can write components as functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 222.52100000000002,
          "en": "after all that is what we did throughout this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 222.52100000000002,
          "end": 224.34,
          "en": "A function is only a valid component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 224.34,
          "end": 227.733,
          "en": "if it returns JSX code or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 228.63,
          "end": 231.32999999999998,
          "en": "This function here however, returns a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 231.32999999999998,
          "end": 232.82999999999998,
          "en": "because as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 233.679,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "import actually yields a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 238.113,
          "en": "And that's not a valid React component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 238.98,
          "end": 240.15,
          "en": "To solve this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 240.15,
          "end": 243.39,
          "en": "React gives us a special function which we have to wrap",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 243.39,
          "end": 245.1,
          "en": "around this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 245.1,
          "end": 249.033,
          "en": "and that's the lazy function which is imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 250.02,
          "end": 253.23,
          "en": "Lazy is executed and takes this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 253.23,
          "end": 255.633,
          "en": "with the dynamic import as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 260.97,
          "en": "And now blog page can indeed be used as a component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 260.97,
          "end": 263.46,
          "en": "So here, where I'm using it as a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 263.46,
          "end": 265.44,
          "en": "this code will now work again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 265.44,
          "end": 267.21,
          "en": "at least almost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 267.21,
          "end": 268.77,
          "en": "it will still take some time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 268.77,
          "end": 271.2,
          "en": "to load the code for this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 271.2,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "because that code has to be downloaded after all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 274.29,
          "end": 277.003,
          "en": "and the effort you must wrap this with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 277.003,
          "end": 278.61,
          "en": "another component provided by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 278.61,
          "end": 280.65,
          "en": "the suspense component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 280.65,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "Which also must be imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 287.13,
          "en": "Now, we saw the suspense component before already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 287.13,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "We already used this suspense component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 291.13,
          "en": "with React router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 292.057,
          "end": 294.36,
          "en": "when we used defer in our loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 294.36,
          "end": 297.345,
          "en": "Suspense is basically a component provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 297.345,
          "end": 300.24,
          "en": "by React that can be used by other things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 300.24,
          "end": 301.41,
          "en": "other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 301.41,
          "end": 304.5,
          "en": "to wait for content to be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 304.5,
          "end": 307.02,
          "en": "before actually rendering the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 307.02,
          "end": 309.78,
          "en": "That's a general way of describing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 309.78,
          "end": 312.03,
          "en": "And here suspense is used to wrap it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 312.03,
          "end": 314.49,
          "en": "around this lazily loaded component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 314.49,
          "end": 316.17,
          "en": "so that we can show a fallback",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 316.17,
          "end": 317.34,
          "en": "which is specified",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 317.34,
          "end": 320.01,
          "en": "with help of the fallback prop on suspense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 320.01,
          "end": 322.53,
          "en": "until that component code is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 322.53,
          "end": 324.003,
          "en": "So here we could say loading.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 325.23,
          "end": 326.43,
          "en": "With that, we're now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 326.43,
          "end": 328.23,
          "en": "loading this block page component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 328.23,
          "end": 329.91,
          "en": "only when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 329.91,
          "end": 332.82,
          "en": "And we show a fallback until the code is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 332.82,
          "end": 334.95,
          "en": "And we're also loading that loader code",
